<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ESSEBI INVESTIMENTI SRL | Consulenza, Progettazione & Sviluppo Immobiliare</title>
    <!-- Font Awesome per Icone -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-blue: #0d47a1;
            --dark-blue: #0a192f;
            --card-blue: #1e3a8a;
            --accent-red: #d32f2f;
            --dark-slate: #1e293b;
            --muted-gray: #64748b;
            --light-bg: #f8fafc;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            color: var(--dark-slate);
            background-color: var(--light-bg);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- NAVIGATION & DROPDOWNS --- */
        header {
            background-color: var(--white);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1250px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 25px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .nav-item {
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-link {
            padding: 12px 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark-slate);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            background-color: rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.05);
        }

        .dropdown-menu {
            position: absolute;
            top: 100%;
            left: 0;
            width: 280px;
            background-color: var(--white);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transform: translateY(10px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            list-style: none;
            border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-red);
        }

        .nav-item:hover .dropdown-menu {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .dropdown-menu li a {
            display: block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            color: var(--dark-slate);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .dropdown-menu li a:hover {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
        }

        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.85)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 140px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 35px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(211, 47, 47, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #b71c1c;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* --- SEZIONI GENERALI --- */
        .section {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-header h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 70px;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-text p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .about-img img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }

        /* --- SEZIONE MANIFESTO --- */
        .manifesto-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a192f 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 90px 20px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .manifesto-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .manifesto-hero-text {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto 70px auto;
        }

        .manifesto-hero-text h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.3;
            color: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .manifesto-keywords {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .keyword-badge {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--white);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 8px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .manifesto-manager-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .manifesto-manager-text h3 {
            font-size: 32px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .manifesto-manager-text p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .manifesto-manager-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 380px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        }

        .manifesto-pillars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 70px;
        }

        .pillar-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-red);
        }

        .pillar-number {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .pillar-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .pillar-desc {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- PROGETTI IN CORSO --- */
        .projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .project-card {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 380px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }

        .badge-status {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .card-overlay {
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 65%);
            height: 100%;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .project-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
            margin-top: auto;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .project-details {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding-top: 10px;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .detail-label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .detail-value {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* --- FORM CONTATTO / NEWSLETTER --- */
        .newsletter-section {
            background-color: #0a192f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-red);
        }

        .newsletter-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .newsletter-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .newsletter-title strong {
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .newsletter-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            max-width: 550px;
        }

        .newsletter-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 22px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 15px;
            outline: none;
        }

        .newsletter-checkbox {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .btn-submit-outline {
            align-self: flex-start;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1.5px solid #ffffff;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 32px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-submit-outline:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .success-box {
            display: none;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid #22c55e;
            color: #22c55e;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            max-width: 550px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        /* --- SERVIZI --- */
        .services-container {
            max-height: 650px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding-right: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--white);
        }

        .service-card {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .service-card:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .service-img {
            width: 220px;
            height: 150px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .service-info h3 {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .service-info p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        /* --- CONTATTI E MAPPA --- */
        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .contact-box {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .contact-info-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .contact-info-list li {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .contact-info-list i {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            background: rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .network-map {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .network-diagram {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            position: relative;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .network-node {
            background: var(--primary-blue);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .network-node.hub {
            background: var(--accent-red);
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .network-connector {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 10%;
            right: 10%;
            height: 3px;
            border-top: 2px dashed var(--primary-blue);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .map-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: var(--primary-blue);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 50px 20px 20px 20px;
        }

        .footer-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-red);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .copyright {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .about-grid, .contact-grid, .manifesto-manager-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .service-card {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .service-img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 180px;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER / NAVIGATION -->
    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo">ESSEBI <span>INVESTIMENTI</span></div>
            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="#home" class="nav-link">Home <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="#chi-siamo">Chi Siamo</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#manifesto">Il Nostro Manifesto</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#progetti">I Nostri Progetti</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#servizi">I Nostri Servizi</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="#manifesto" class="nav-link">Manifesto <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="#manifesto">Valori & Visione</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#manifesto-manager">Sviluppo & Advisory</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#manifesto-pilastri">I 3 Pilastri</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="#servizi" class="nav-link">Servizi <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="#servizi">Investimenti Immobiliari</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#servizi">Progettazione & Riqualificazione</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#servizi">Consulenza Strategica</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#servizi">Valutazione e Asset Management</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="#contatti" class="nav-link">Contatti <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><a href="#contatti">Sede di Volpago del M.llo</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#rete-territorio">Rete Treviso - Padova - Vicenza</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#dati-societari">Dati Fiscali e PEC</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Valore ed Eccellenza nel Settore Immobiliare</h1>
            <p>Pianificazione finanziaria, advisory e progettazione su misura per trasformare ogni operazione immobiliare in un investimento solido e redditizio.</p>
            <a href="#contatti" class="btn-primary">Richiedi una Consulenza</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CHI SIAMO -->
    <section class="section" id="chi-siamo">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>ESSEBI INVESTIMENTI SRL</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p><strong>ESSEBI INVESTIMENTI SRL</strong> nasce con l'obiettivo di ridefinire gli standard della consulenza e dello sviluppo immobiliare nel Triveneto. Uniamo una profonda competenza tecnica a un’accurata visione del mercato finanziario ed edilizio.</p>
                <p>La nostra società opera come partner strategico per privati, aziende ed investitori istituzionali. Analizziamo l'intero ciclo di vita dell'operazione: dalla ricerca dell'opportunità alla progettazione architettonica, fino alla riqualificazione finale.</p>
                <p>Grazie a una presenza radicata a Volpago del Montello e a una fitta rete di partnership estesa da Treviso fino alle province di Padova e Vicenza, garantiamo massima sicurezza, redditività e trasparenza.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-img">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560518883-ce09059eeffa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Consulenza Immobiliare">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SEZIONE MANIFESTO -->
    <section class="manifesto-section" id="manifesto">
        <div class="manifesto-container">
            <div class="manifesto-hero-text">
                <h2>Miglioriamo il mondo un immobile alla volta con:</h2>
                <div class="manifesto-keywords">
                    <span class="keyword-badge">PASSIONE</span>
                    <span class="keyword-badge">ETICA</span>
                    <span class="keyword-badge">TRASPARENZA</span>
                    <span class="keyword-badge">AMBIZIONE</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="manifesto-manager-grid" id="manifesto-manager">
                <div class="manifesto-manager-text">
                    <h3>L'ambiente in cui viviamo determina la qualità della nostra vita</h3>
                    <p>
                        Essebi Investimenti lavora per il recupero di edifici e la riqualificazione ad alta efficienza energetica, trasformandoli in opportunità di valore per famiglie e investitori. 
                        Ogni nostro progetto si contraddistingue per l'elevata attenzione alla qualità architettonica e alla sostenibilità del patrimonio immobiliare.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#progetti" class="btn-primary">Scopri le Operazioni</a>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <!-- MANAGER 50 ANNI FORMALE CON CAMICIA, CRAVATTA E LAPTOP -->
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519085360753-af0119f7cbe7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Manager Essebi Investimenti" class="manifesto-manager-img">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="manifesto-pillars" id="manifesto-pilastri">
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-number">01</div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">SOSTENIBILITÀ</div>
                    <p class="pillar-desc">
                        L'impatto energetico di ogni nostro edificio è ridotto al minimo grazie alla qualificazione nelle classi energetiche più elevate.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">ECCELLENZA</div>
                    <p class="pillar-desc">
                        La scelta dei materiali ricade su prodotti e partner d'eccellenza che condividono la nostra visione di sviluppo sostenibile.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
                    <div class="pillar-title">TRASPARENZA</div>
                    <p class="pillar-desc">
                        Sappiamo quanto sia fondamentale la fiducia degli investitori: ogni fase dell'operazione è gestita e rendicontata con totale trasparenza.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SEZIONE PROGETTI -->
    <section class="section" id="progetti">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Non perderti i nostri progetti</h2>
            <p style="margin-top: 10px; color: #64748b;">Operazioni immobiliari in corso di sviluppo e riqualificazione</p>
        </div>

        <div class="projects-grid">
            <div class="project-card" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');">
                <span class="badge-status">In Corso</span>
                <div class="card-overlay">
                    <div class="project-name">Villa Ulivi</div>
                    <div class="project-details">
                        <div><span class="detail-label">UNITÀ ABITATIVE</span><span class="detail-value">3 ville</span></div>
                        <div><span class="detail-label">INTERVENTO</span><span class="detail-value">Costruzione</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753376-12c8ab7fb75b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80');">
                <span class="badge-status">In Corso</span>
                <div class="card-overlay">
